            <description><![CDATA[

        <h2>ExtraDock 5.0.6 (Beta 2) - Smoother Docks, Steadier Layout</h2>

        <h3>Improvements</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Smoother pointer tracking:</strong> Moving the pointer no longer re-runs the full dock geometry pass on every movement, so docks stay responsive!</li>
            <li><strong>Ambient effects:</strong> Ambient effects now render beneath your app icons instead of over them!</li>
            <li><strong>Dock shortcuts:</strong> A dock's keyboard shortcut can now switch a disabled dock back on and off again!</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Reserve Dock Space:</strong> Reserved space no longer churns on every animation tick, and it no longer goes silently stale!</li>
            <li><strong>Pinned top docks:</strong> Docks pinned to the top of the screen now stay below the menu bar!</li>
            <li><strong>Dock item labels:</strong> Item labels appear above macOS desktop widgets and stay below normal app windows, so they are never covered on the desktop!</li>
        </ul>
            ]]></description>

